    "serial": null,
    "original_requirement": "构建一个智能鱼缸环境维持系统，使用水温传感器 LM35（A1）、光敏电阻 A0、水位传感器 A2、加热器 D10、照明 LED D9、水泵或增氧泵 D5、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和蜂鸣器 D6。系统根据水温控制加热器，根据环境光照控制鱼缸照明，根据水位控制增氧泵保护；若水位过低则关闭相关设备并报警。按钮 D2 可切换显示水温、光照和水位。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个智能鱼缸环境维持系统，使用水温传感器 LM35（A1）、光敏电阻 A0、水位传感器 A2、加热器 D10、照明 LED D9、水泵或增氧泵 D5、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D3）和蜂鸣器 D6。系统根据水温控制加热器，根据环境光照控制鱼缸照明，根据水位控制增氧泵保护；若水位过低则关闭相关设备并报警。按钮 D2 可切换显示水温、光照和水位。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A1\"}, {\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A0\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D10\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D5\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D9\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D3\"}], \"serial\": null}",
